test_*.py
# Exception: the VAE component-toggle refusal matrix is a checked-in regression
# guard for design.md §4 (see docs/guides/VAE_TRAINING.md), not a scratch script.
!backend/tests/test_vae_refusal_matrix.py
# Exception: metadata path redaction. Its two failure modes -- corrupting a
# recorded prompt, and leaking a filesystem path into a shared PNG -- are both
# silent, so the fixtures for them have to be checked in.
!backend/tests/test_path_redaction.py
# Exception: generation-warning persistence. Both regressions it guards are
# silent by construction -- a warning that is raised and then dropped before
# anything writes it to the row leaves no trace anywhere.
!backend/tests/test_warning_persistence.py
# Exception: outpaint preserved-rect contract. A regression here repaints
# pixels the user explicitly asked to keep untouched, and the result still
# looks like a plausible image -- there is no error, no crash, just quietly
# wrong output.
!backend/tests/test_outpaint_utils.py
# Exception: outpaint RePaint-style resample schedule. A regression here
# silently changes NFE/anchor placement or breaks the byte-identical
# plain-walk fallback for non-outpaint calls -- no crash, just a subtly
# different (or subtly worse) generation with no signal that anything moved.
!backend/tests/test_outpaint_resample_schedule.py
# Exception: Danbooru online-learning interrupt-batch scheme. This file is the
# reason the blanket ignore is a hazard -- 1dc6b4cf changed MixedDataLoader's
# kwargs, yield shape and injection semantics at once, and nothing caught it
# because git had never seen the test.
!backend/tests/test_danbooru_online_learning.py
# Exception: tagger vocab-expansion optimizer-state migration. A regression
# here silently corrupts or drops per-tag momentum on vocab resize -- training
# keeps running, just with wrong optimizer state for every affected tag row.
!tests/test_optimizer_migrate.py

